Subject: [PATCH] fix(everything): use relatedTask option to enable elicitation
 over HTTP (#3228)

---
 src/everything/__tests__/tools.test.ts        | 85 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../tools/simulate-research-query.ts          | 34 +++-----
 2 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/everything/__tests__/tools.test.ts b/src/everything/__tests__/tools.test.ts
